//! name: linear-impl-outside-defining-module-rejected
//! rule: 08.R21
//! expect: check-error
//! detail: N0021 -- `impl Linear for lib.Res` in `main`: `Linear` is a prelude trait (package std) and `Res` is defined in `lib`; `main` is neither (ch01 R22: the `impl` MUST appear in the defining module, as for `Shared`)

module main;
needs { };
use lib;

impl Linear for lib.Res { }
